  ($v$greenhouse gas$v$, 'phrase', $v$/ˈɡriːnhaʊs ɡæs/$v$, $v$A gas that traps heat in the atmosphere.$v$, $v$Methane is a far more potent greenhouse gas than carbon dioxide.$v$, '{}'::text[], '{}'::text[], '6.5'),
